  "description": "The Swampmaster introduces a completely new direction for Wethepeople as the first full-suspension BMX complete. Drawing inspiration from BMX’s early, more experimental days, it merges MTB capability with BMX simplicity and flow. Designed in Cologne, Germany, it’s made for mixed terrain riding—from bike parks to dirt jumps—while keeping the playful feel that defines BMX. A carefully selected build of Wethepeople aftermarket parts and MTB components from Maxxis and Manitou gives it both durability and versatility. A first of its kind production bike, the Swampmaster signals a new evolution in BMX and MTB crossover design.",
